# Release output
/dist/

# The console's build output and its dependencies. The source and the lockfile
# are the record; 235 kB of hashed bundle regenerated on every build is not.
# No trailing slash on node_modules: in a worktree it is a symlink to the main
# checkout's, `node_modules/` matches only a directory, and the link was once
# committed carrying the absolute path of the machine it was made on.
node_modules
web/*/dist/
.serena/
